  <item>
    <title>005 探秘第37届百花奖幕后故事，我们的同学获奖了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b60e56db5e6d6bf9258a14</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b60e56db5e6d6bf9258a14</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 Aug 2024 12:40:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第三十七届大众电影百花奖在成都落幕，今年的颁奖结果颇具亮点。曾任《大众电影》杂志宣传的</span><strong><span>追新妹</span></strong><span>与本届最佳编剧获得者的同窗</span><strong><span>怀旧姐</span></strong><span>有很多关于百花奖的幕后花絮要来讲给大家听。这些奖项究竟背后有何故事？让我们一起走进这个光影世界，探寻他们成功背后的秘密。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:00:42</a> &nbsp;第37届百花奖揭晓，我们的同学获奖啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">00:02:15</a> 大众电影百花奖评选方式变迁，代表大众喜欢的“群众奖”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">00:05:48</a> 张艺谋凭《第二十条》首次获最佳导演奖，他的全能导演之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">00:09:16</a> 85后小花转型：最佳女配赵丽颖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">00:11:05</a> 最佳女主角马丽：喜剧演员为何难获奖项肯定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">00:17:54</a> 贾玲《热辣滚烫》再次获得最佳导演提名</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">00:21:01</a> 赵丽颖的演艺突破：从古偶到现实主义题材的蜕变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1526">00:25:26</a> 李雪健与费翔：演技精湛的角色塑造，成就封神之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">00:29:27</a> 于适：最佳新人奖颇具亮点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1886">00:31:26</a> 《年会不能停》最佳编剧奖实至名归</span></p><span></span><p><span>两张彩蛋：与李雪健老师、宁静老师的合影~~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FignFMeJz4jkz7f3NXErBn8CurIP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqdeYRk2bg003mTNtaIqnV5INET1.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
